Package: grumpy-common
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: shared private libraries for GrumpyChat
 GrumpyChat is a Qt IRC client with distributed-core support.
 .
 This package provides private shared libraries used by the GrumpyChat
 desktop client and daemon.

Package: grumpy
Architecture: any
Depends: grumpy-common (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt IRC client with distributed-core support
 GrumpyChat is an IRC client with a distributed core and JavaScript scripting
 support.
 .
 This package provides the desktop client.

Package: grumpyd
Architecture: any
Depends: grumpy-common (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GrumpyChat distributed-core daemon
 GrumpyChat can use a daemon as a distributed IRC core.
 .
 This package provides the optional daemon.
